linuxon-appstream-catalog — AppStream metadata for the Linuxon eopkg repository

The catalog data in this package (component ids, categories, package
associations, file layout) is released under CC0 1.0 Universal
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

The application names, summaries, descriptions, licenses and icons embedded
in the catalog come from the packages of the Linuxon repository, which are
distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later (see each package's own
/usr/share/licenses/<package>/LICENSE).
